{"t":"say","text":"I'll design a self-hosted Dify on ACK in Frankfurt, calling Qwen via Model Studio and reading documents from OSS."}
{"t":"req","text":"Data stays in Frankfurt region","regions":["eu-central-1"]}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","alb","ack","dify-on-ack","acr","model-studio","oss","milvus","rds","tair","sls","nat","eip","vpc"]}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Employees","group":"internet","why":"Company staff accessing the knowledge assistant."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Alibaba Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"Resolves internal assistant domain to ALB."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"frankfurt","kind":"region","label":"Frankfurt (eu-central-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Dify VPC","parent":"frankfurt"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Routes employee HTTPS traffic into the cluster."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-alb","from":"users","to":"alb","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"node","id":"ack","product":"ack","label":"ACK Cluster","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Kubernetes cluster hosting all Dify components."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-ack","from":"alb","to":"ack","label":"HTTP"}
{"t":"node","id":"dify","product":"dify-on-ack","label":"Dify","group":"vpc","attachTo":"ack","why":"Self-hosted RAG and agent builder running on ACK."}
{"t":"node","id":"acr","product":"acr","label":"Container Registry","group":"frankfurt","why":"Stores custom Dify container images securely."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-acr","from":"ack","to":"acr","label":"pull","kind":"data"}
{"t":"say","text":"Now adding the AI, data and storage services that Dify depends on."}
{"t":"node","id":"model-studio","product":"model-studio","label":"Model Studio","group":"frankfurt","why":"Provides Qwen model APIs for document understanding."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-model","from":"ack","to":"model-studio","label":"API","kind":"data"}
{"t":"node","id":"oss","product":"oss","label":"Company Docs OSS","group":"frankfurt","why":"Stores company documents ingested by Dify for RAG."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-oss","from":"ack","to":"oss","label":"read","kind":"data"}
{"t":"node","id":"vector","product":"milvus","label":"Milvus Vector DB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Holds document embeddings for semantic search in RAG."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-vector","from":"ack","to":"vector","label":"query","kind":"data"}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"rds","label":"RDS PostgreSQL","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Dify metadata store for apps, workflows and users."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-db","from":"ack","to":"db","label":"SQL","kind":"data"}
{"t":"node","id":"cache","product":"tair","label":"Tair Cache","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Caches sessions and rate limits for Dify workers."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-cache","from":"ack","to":"cache","label":"Redis","kind":"data"}
{"t":"say","text":"Adding networking egress and observability."}
{"t":"node","id":"nat","product":"nat","label":"NAT Gateway","group":"vpc","why":"Outbound internet access for ACK worker nodes."}
{"t":"node","id":"eip","product":"eip","label":"EIP","group":"vpc","attachTo":"nat","why":"Public IP for NAT Gateway egress traffic."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-nat","from":"ack","to":"nat","label":"egress","kind":"data"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"SLS Logs","group":"frankfurt","why":"Centralized logs and tracing for Dify and ACK."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-logs","from":"ack","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Self-hosted Dify on ACK in Frankfurt with Model Studio for Qwen, OSS for documents, Milvus for vectors, RDS and Tair."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll design a product catalog API behind ESA and ALB, with RDS for data, OSS for images, and Tair for caching."}
{"t":"req","text":"Elasticsearch is strictly banned due to licensing concerns","avoid":["elasticsearch"]}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","esa","alb","waf","cloud-native-api-gateway","ecs","ess","tair","rds","oss","sls"]}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Marketplace users","group":"internet","why":"Shoppers and sellers browsing the catalog."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"Resolves the marketplace domain to ESA."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"edge","kind":"edge","label":"Edge","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"esa","product":"esa","label":"ESA","group":"edge","why":"Accelerates API responses and caches product images."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-esa","from":"users","to":"esa","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Catalog VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Distributes traffic across two zones."}
{"t":"node","id":"waf","product":"waf","label":"WAF","group":"vpc","attachTo":"alb","why":"Protects the API from injection and bots."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-alb","from":"esa","to":"alb","label":"origin"}
{"t":"node","id":"gateway","product":"cloud-native-api-gateway","label":"API Gateway","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Routes catalog API calls with auth and throttling."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-gateway","from":"alb","to":"gateway"}
{"t":"node","id":"app","product":"ecs","label":"Catalog API servers","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Runs the product catalog business logic."}
{"t":"node","id":"scaling","product":"ess","label":"Auto Scaling","group":"vpc","attachTo":"app","why":"Scales servers during traffic spikes."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-gateway-app","from":"gateway","to":"app"}
{"t":"say","text":"Adding Tair for fast lookups, RDS for product data, and OSS for image storage."}
{"t":"node","id":"cache","product":"tair","label":"Product cache","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Caches hot product queries for low latency."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-cache","from":"app","to":"cache"}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"rds","label":"Catalog DB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Stores product records with zone standby."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-db","from":"app","to":"db","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"node","id":"images","product":"oss","label":"Product images","group":"sg","why":"Stores and serves product photos via ESA."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-images","from":"app","to":"images","label":"upload"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-images","from":"esa","to":"images","label":"fetch"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Logs","group":"sg","why":"Centralizes API access and error logs."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-logs","from":"app","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Product catalog API with ESA, ALB plus WAF, API Gateway, ECS with Auto Scaling, Tair cache, RDS database and OSS image storage."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll add AnalyticDB for fast full-text and fuzzy search over product titles and descriptions, respecting the Elasticsearch ban."}
{"t":"req","text":"Elasticsearch is strictly banned due to licensing concerns","avoid":["elasticsearch"]}
{"t":"node","id":"search","product":"analyticdb","label":"Product search","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Full-text and fuzzy search over product titles and descriptions."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-search","from":"app","to":"search","label":"search"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Added AnalyticDB node for full-text and fuzzy product search, keeping Elasticsearch banned."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll design a claims portal in Tokyo with ESA, ALB, WAF, ECS, RDS and OSS, keeping all data in Japan."}
{"t":"req","text":"All policyholder data must remain physically within Japan","regions":["ap-northeast-1"]}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","esa","alb","waf","ecs","ess","rds","oss","sls","kms"]}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Policyholders","group":"internet","why":"Customers submitting insurance claims."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"Resolves the portal domain to ESA."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"edge","kind":"edge","label":"Edge","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"esa","product":"esa","label":"ESA","group":"edge","why":"Accelerates portal access for Japanese users."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-esa","from":"users","to":"esa","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"group","id":"tokyo","kind":"region","label":"Tokyo (ap-northeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Claims VPC","parent":"tokyo"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Routes traffic across two zones."}
{"t":"node","id":"waf","product":"waf","label":"WAF","group":"vpc","attachTo":"alb","why":"Protects the claims portal from attacks."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-alb","from":"esa","to":"alb","label":"origin"}
{"t":"node","id":"app","product":"ecs","label":"Portal servers","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Runs the claims application in two zones."}
{"t":"node","id":"scaling","product":"ess","label":"Auto Scaling","group":"vpc","attachTo":"app","why":"Scales servers during claim peaks."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-app","from":"alb","to":"app"}
{"t":"say","text":"Claims go to RDS and documents to OSS, both encrypted with KMS and staying in Tokyo."}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"rds","label":"Claims DB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Stores claim records with zone standby."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-db","from":"app","to":"db","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"node","id":"docs","product":"oss","label":"Claim documents","group":"tokyo","why":"Stores policyholder document submissions."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-docs","from":"app","to":"docs","label":"upload"}
{"t":"node","id":"kms","product":"kms","label":"KMS","group":"tokyo","why":"Encrypts database and storage at rest."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-db-kms","from":"db","to":"kms","kind":"control"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-docs-kms","from":"docs","to":"kms","kind":"control"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Logs","group":"tokyo","why":"Central logs for audit compliance."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-logs","from":"app","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Claims portal in Tokyo with ESA, ALB with WAF, ECS, RDS, OSS and KMS, all data in Japan."}

{"t":"say","text":"I cannot replicate policyholder data to Singapore because your pinned requirement keeps all data in Tokyo (ap-northeast-1)."}
{"t":"say","text":"Instead, I will add Quick BI and AnalyticDB inside Tokyo so the analytics team queries dashboards without data leaving Japan."}
{"t":"plan","products":["analyticdb","quick-bi","dts"]}
{"t":"node","id":"dw","product":"analyticdb","label":"Analytics warehouse","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Stores claims data for reporting inside Tokyo only."}
{"t":"node","id":"bi","product":"quick-bi","label":"Reporting dashboards","group":"tokyo","why":"Lets Singapore analysts view dashboards; data stays in Tokyo."}
{"t":"insert","id":"sync","product":"dts","label":"DTS sync","why":"Replicates claims DB to analytics warehouse within Tokyo.","on":"e-app-db"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-dw-bi","from":"dw","to":"bi","label":"query"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Added AnalyticDB, DTS and Quick BI in Tokyo so Singapore analysts can run dashboards without moving data out of Japan."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll add a Qwen chatbot to the portal using Model Studio in Tokyo, with AI Guardrails for safe insurance responses."}
{"t":"node","id":"llm","product":"model-studio","label":"Qwen chatbot API","group":"tokyo","why":"Answers policyholder questions via Qwen model APIs in Tokyo."}
{"t":"node","id":"guardrails","product":"ai-guardrails","label":"AI Guardrails","group":"tokyo","why":"Blocks prompt injection and harmful content in chatbot replies."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-llm","from":"app","to":"llm","label":"chat"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-llm-guardrails","from":"llm","to":"guardrails","kind":"control"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Added Model Studio (Qwen) and AI Guardrails in Tokyo so the portal can answer policyholder questions safely."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll design a private hybrid setup: your on-prem data center connects to Jakarta via Express Connect into a VPC hosting MongoDB and RDS."}
{"t":"req","text":"Databases stay in Jakarta region, no public internet exposure","regions":["ap-southeast-5"]}
{"t":"plan","products":["onprem-dc","express-connect","vpc","mongodb","rds","privatezone"]}
{"t":"group","id":"onprem","kind":"onprem","label":"On-premises data center","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"dc","product":"onprem-dc","label":"App servers","group":"onprem","why":"Runs the SaaS application servers that query databases privately."}
{"t":"group","id":"jakarta","kind":"region","label":"Jakarta (ap-southeast-5)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Database VPC","parent":"jakarta"}
{"t":"node","id":"ec-onprem","product":"express-connect","label":"Express Connect (DC side)","group":"onprem","why":"Dedicated physical line from the data center into the Jakarta VPC."}
{"t":"node","id":"ec-vpc","product":"express-connect","label":"Express Connect (VPC side)","group":"vpc","why":"Virtual border router terminating the dedicated line inside the VPC."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-dc-ec","from":"dc","to":"ec-onprem","label":"private link","kind":"data"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ec-ec","from":"ec-onprem","to":"ec-vpc","label":"dedicated line","kind":"data"}
{"t":"node","id":"mongo","product":"mongodb","label":"Managed MongoDB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Stores document workloads for the SaaS platform with HA replica set."}
{"t":"node","id":"pg","product":"rds","label":"RDS PostgreSQL","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Relational store for structured SaaS data with zone standby."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ec-mongo","from":"ec-vpc","to":"mongo","label":"private","kind":"data"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ec-pg","from":"ec-vpc","to":"pg","label":"private","kind":"data"}
{"t":"node","id":"pzone","product":"privatezone","label":"PrivateZone","group":"vpc","attachTo":"vpc","why":"Resolves database endpoints to private IPs within the VPC only."}
{"t":"done","summary":"Jakarta VPC with managed MongoDB and RDS PostgreSQL, reachable from your data center only over Express Connect with no public exposure."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll design a live-streaming platform with strong DDoS and WAF defenses, following the required traffic order."}
{"t":"say","text":"Note: Anti-DDoS Proxy must sit behind ESA, not in front of it. I will route users -> ESA -> Anti-DDoS Proxy -> ALB to comply with catalog rules while keeping both defenses."}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","esa","anti-ddos-proxy","waf","alb","ecs","tair","sls"]}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Viewers","group":"internet","why":"Audience watching live streams."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"Resolves streaming domain to ESA."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"edge","kind":"edge","label":"Edge Defense","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"esa","product":"esa","label":"ESA","group":"edge","why":"Caches static assets and provides first-line DDoS defense."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-esa","from":"users","to":"esa","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"node","id":"ddos","product":"anti-ddos-proxy","label":"Anti-DDoS Proxy","group":"edge","why":"Scrubbing center for large L3-L7 attacks behind ESA."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-ddos","from":"esa","to":"ddos","label":"scrubbed"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Streaming VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Distributes clean traffic to app servers across zones."}
{"t":"node","id":"waf","product":"waf","label":"WAF","group":"vpc","attachTo":"alb","why":"Blocks OWASP attacks and bots at the load balancer."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ddos-alb","from":"ddos","to":"alb","label":"origin"}
{"t":"node","id":"app","product":"ecs","label":"Stream App Servers","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Runs the live-streaming application logic."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-app","from":"alb","to":"app","label":"HTTP"}
{"t":"node","id":"cache","product":"tair","label":"Session Cache","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Stores viewer sessions and stream metadata fast."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-cache","from":"app","to":"cache","label":"Redis"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Logs","group":"sg","why":"Centralizes attack and access logs for analysis."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-logs","from":"app","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"rec","product":"live","fit":"complement","why":"Managed ingest, transcoding and playback for live video streams."}
{"t":"rec","product":"rts","fit":"complement","why":"Ultra-low-latency live streaming delivery from the edge."}
{"t":"done","summary":"Live-streaming architecture routed through ESA then Anti-DDoS Proxy into an ALB with WAF, ECS app servers and Tair cache."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll design a photo-sharing backend with ECS behind an ALB, RDS for metadata and OSS for images. No Function Compute."}
{"t":"req","text":"No serverless functions; Function Compute is forbidden","avoid":["fc"]}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","esa","alb","waf","ecs","ess","rds","oss","tair","sls"]}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"App users","group":"internet","why":"People uploading and viewing photos."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"Resolves the app domain to ESA."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"edge","kind":"edge","label":"Edge","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"esa","product":"esa","label":"ESA","group":"edge","why":"Accelerates image delivery and caches static assets globally."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-esa","from":"users","to":"esa","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"App VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Routes HTTP traffic across two zones to ECS instances."}
{"t":"node","id":"waf","product":"waf","label":"WAF","group":"vpc","attachTo":"alb","why":"Protects the API from injection and bot attacks."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-alb","from":"esa","to":"alb","label":"origin"}
{"t":"node","id":"app","product":"ecs","label":"App servers","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Runs the photo-sharing backend on managed VMs."}
{"t":"node","id":"scaling","product":"ess","label":"Auto Scaling","group":"vpc","attachTo":"app","why":"Scales ECS instances based on CPU or traffic."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-app","from":"alb","to":"app"}
{"t":"say","text":"Metadata goes to RDS, sessions to Tair, and uploaded images are stored in OSS served via ESA."}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"rds","label":"Photo metadata DB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Stores user data, photo metadata and comments."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-db","from":"app","to":"db","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"node","id":"cache","product":"tair","label":"Session cache","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Caches sessions and hot photo metadata for speed."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-cache","from":"app","to":"cache"}
{"t":"node","id":"images","product":"oss","label":"Image storage","group":"sg","why":"Durable object storage for all uploaded photos."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-images","from":"app","to":"images","label":"upload"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-images","from":"esa","to":"images","label":"fetch"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Logs","group":"sg","why":"Collects application logs for monitoring and debugging."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-logs","from":"app","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Photo-sharing backend on ECS with ALB, WAF, RDS, Tair and OSS for images, without any serverless functions."}

{"t":"say","text":"Since Function Compute is forbidden, I'll add an ECS worker that polls OSS for new uploads and generates thumbnails."}
{"t":"node","id":"thumb-worker","product":"ecs","label":"Thumbnail worker","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Polls OSS for new photos and generates thumbnails without serverless functions."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-thumb-worker-images","from":"thumb-worker","to":"images","label":"read/write"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Added a two-zone ECS thumbnail worker that reads new uploads from OSS and writes back generated thumbnails."}

{"t":"say","text":"한국 개인정보보호법에 따라 모든 이용자 데이터를 서울 리전에 유지하는 게임 서버 아키텍처를 구성하겠습니다."}
{"t":"req","text":"이용자 개인정보는 반드시 서울 리전에 보관해야 합니다","regions":["ap-northeast-2"]}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","esa","alb","waf","ecs","ess","tair","rds","oss","sls"]}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"인터넷","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"플레이어","group":"internet","why":"게임에 접속하는 이용자"}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Alibaba Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"게임 도메인을 ESA로 해석"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"edge","kind":"edge","label":"엣지","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"esa","product":"esa","label":"ESA","group":"edge","why":"정적 자산 캐싱 및 DDoS 방어"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-esa","from":"users","to":"esa","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"group","id":"seoul","kind":"region","label":"Seoul (ap-northeast-2)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"게임 VPC","parent":"seoul"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"두 존으로 트래픽 분산"}
{"t":"node","id":"waf","product":"waf","label":"WAF","group":"vpc","attachTo":"alb","why":"API 공격 및 봇 차단"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-alb","from":"esa","to":"alb","label":"origin"}
{"t":"node","id":"game-server","product":"ecs","label":"게임 서버","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"서울 2개 존에서 게임 로직 실행"}
{"t":"node","id":"scaling","product":"ess","label":"Auto Scaling","group":"vpc","attachTo":"game-server","why":"접속자 수에 따라 서버 자동 증설"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-game","from":"alb","to":"game-server"}
{"t":"say","text":"세션은 Tair에, 플레이어 데이터는 RDS에 저장하며 모두 서울 리전 내에서 고가용성으로 운영됩니다."}
{"t":"node","id":"cache","product":"tair","label":"세션 캐시","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"게임 세션과 랭킹을 빠르게 처리"}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"rds","label":"플레이어 DB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"개인정보 포함 플레이어 데이터 저장"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-game-cache","from":"game-server","to":"cache"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-game-db","from":"game-server","to":"db","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"node","id":"media","product":"oss","label":"게임 에셋 스토리지","group":"seoul","why":"패치 파일 및 미디어 에셋 저장"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-media","from":"esa","to":"media","label":"assets"}
